==Battleground==
*1 [[Dark Emperor Nyandam]] spawns as the boss after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>.
*3 [[Vlad de Sable]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 2~5 seconds<sup>60f~150f</sup>.
*10 [[Cow Doge]]s spawn after 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>, delay 16.67~23.33 seconds<sup>500f~700f</sup>.
*5 [[Sir Seal]]s spawn after 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>, delay 20~30 seconds<sup>600f~900f</sup>.
*5 [[Vlad de Sable]]s spawn after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>, delay 6~15 seconds<sup>180f~450f</sup>.
*1 [[Bang-Bang]] spawns after 46.67 seconds<sup>1,400f</sup>.
*1 [[Bang-Bang]] spawns after 73.33 seconds<sup>2,200f</sup>.
*1 [[Bang-Bang]] spawns after 93.33 seconds<sup>2,800f</sup>.
*1 [[Bearkini]] spawns after 60 seconds<sup>1,800f</sup>.
*1 [[Bearkini]] spawns after 86.67 seconds<sup>2,600f</sup>.
*1 [[Bearkini]] spawns after 106.67 seconds<sup>3,200f</sup>.
*3 [[Jackie Peng]]s spawn after 60 seconds<sup>1,800f</sup>, delay 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>.

==Strategy==
The stages start off is generous, although [[Double Bounty]] units like [[Can Can Cat]] or [[Bullet Train Cat]] may be needed to fully exploit it before the first Sir Seal spawns. The stronger [[Traitless Enemies|Traitless]] enemies only starting spawning 47 seconds in, so their counters can be saved until then, or alternatively that time can be used to simply rush down the boss and base with [[Courier Cat]] spam, especially since the initial support is very weak.

